+Naumi Blender integration uses the public MCP TypeScript SDK 2.2.0 (MIT) and the existing Harness MCP client.
+The local Blender addon retains the core command envelope and vocabulary of ahujasid/blender-mcp (MIT), reviewed at b6a2ce30c14636a562b5549684d9db6fc01f29ab (mcp-for-blender 2.3.0).
+This is a narrowly scoped Naumi bridge, not the full upstream distribution. Its stdlib-only Blender-side bootstrap, authenticated profile-scoped transport, durable receipts and lifecycle are Naumi-owned. No upstream telemetry, paid generation service or auto-updater is included.
+Blender itself is not redistributed by this package. The user-selected installed Blender is a separate process.
